ounds (shallow snowpack, no daily forecast) but not none in backcountry; tree wells de-emphasized; Olympic-venue activity safety (bobsled/coaster/jumps/skating — follow ORDA staff + limits)"},"timing":{"peak":"High winter (Christmas/NY, MLK + Presidents'' wknds, Feb) ski + winter venues + weekend peaks (NYC/Montreal/Boston drive market); summer Jul-Aug (lake, High Peaks, venue tours)","shoulder":"early season (mid-late Dec), Jan weekdays, March spring skiing, fall foliage (late Sep-mid Oct)","green":"Apr-May + Nov-early Dec (between-season lulls / mud season — verify)","booking_lead":"Christmas/NY + top lodges 6-12 mo; Presidents''/Feb 3-6 mo; summer lake + foliage 3-6 mo; shoulder/midweek 1-8 wk (weekend drive-in Northeast/Montreal ski market)","off_season_specials":"March spring-ski deals; summer lake + High Peaks + Olympic-venue-tour layer (Jun-Oct); fall foliage; Olympic-heritage day-visits year-round","event_peaks":"Christmas/NY, MLK + Presidents'' wknds, US school half-terms, fall foliage (late Sep-mid Oct), ORDA winter-sport competitions (verify 2027), summer lake holidays (Jul 4)","campaign_start":"FIRE ski mid-late Mar (ahead of Apr-Jun early-bird) + late Aug-early Sep (ahead of Sep-Nov fall wave); market summer lake/Olympic-venue/foliage by Jan-Feb"},"jewels":[{"name":"Ski the biggest vertical in the East — Whiteface","si_tag":"Winter / Ski","status":"future","tier":"comfort","price_band":"~USD 95-189/day lift","timing":"ski ~late Dec-Mar, snow + wind-dependent","draw_rank":1,"hook":"the greatest continuous vertical drop in eastern North America, ~3,430 ft; ~94 trails over ~299 acres, 12 lifts, ~99% snowmaking","si":"Winter / Ski","blurb":"the greatest continuous vertical drop in eastern North America, ~3,430 ft; ~94 trails over ~299 acres, 12 lifts, ~99% snowmaking","when":"ski ~late Dec-Mar, snow + wind-dependent","commission":"DMC/ski-op 10-20% (embedded-capable)"},{"name":"Hike The Slides on the right day","si_tag":"Winter / Ski","status":"future","tie