ired","activity_note":"ALTITUDE (base ~6,900 ft moderate, summit ~10,026 ft - milder AMS risk; hydrate, ease alcohol, descend if worsening); AVALANCHE backcountry (Park City ridgeline + Uintas) - Utah Avalanche Center (UAC) ''Salt Lake'' region (Uintas region for the Powder Cats backcountry) - VERIFY exact zone (UAC pages 403); beacon/probe/shovel + guide, never duck ropes; tree-wells; cold + intense UV; I-80/Parley''s winter driving + UDOT traction (less canyon-closure risk than the Cottonwoods)"},"timing":{"peak":"High winter (Christmas/NY, Sundance 22 Jan-1 Feb 2026, MLK, Presidents'', Feb-Mar); final Utah Sundance amplifies late-Jan","shoulder":"early season (late Nov-mid Dec), Jan midweek outside Sundance, April spring skiing","green":"May-Jun + Oct-Nov lull; summer Kimball Arts + biking + Utah Olympic Park","booking_lead":"Christmas/NY + Presidents'' + Sundance + Canyons luxury 4-8 mo (Sundance lodging ~1 yr); regular winter 3-6 mo; spring 1-3 mo","off_season_specials":"April spring-skiing; summer Kimball Arts + biking + Olympic Park; midweek value","event_peaks":"Christmas/NY, Sundance (22 Jan-1 Feb 2026, final Utah edition), MLK + Presidents'', spring break, Kimball Arts (summer - verify)","campaign_start":"FIRE spring early-bird (Apr-Jun) Epic renewals + Sundance-farewell + luxury pre-book (Sundance far ahead); fire again Sep-Nov"},"jewels":[{"name":"Ski the largest resort in America","si_tag":"Winter/Ski","status":"live","tier":"comfort","price_band":"window dynamic; package far better value","timing":"ski Nov-Apr","draw_rank":1,"hook":"~7,300 marketed acres across Park City and Canyons on one Epic pass, linked by the Quicksilver Gondola","si":"ski","blurb":"~7,300 marketed acres across Park City and Canyons on one Epic pass, linked by the Quicksilver Gondola","when":"ski Nov-Apr","commission":"DMC/ski-op 10-15% (embedded-capable)"},{"name":"Ride the Quicksilver Gondola between two mountains","si_tag":"Winter/Ski","status":"live","tier":"comfort","price_ba